# Run O (2026-11-07, user: "Restart with both fixes"): run N (slurm/sac_scratch_2t_u5.env:
# SAC from scratch, no pretraining, one update every 5 env steps, Town05 + Town01)
# with two reward changes, both in goal and explore mode (goal mode is paid the
# explore reward):
#   * OFF-ROAD ENDS THE EPISODE IN TRAINING, as it does in every eval
#     (EXPLORE_OFF_ROAD_FATAL=1; it was a 1.0/step fine, the 2026-10-19 rule), with
#     the eval's junction rule (OFF_ROAD_JUNCTION_M=3.5, df58898): inside a junction
#     an off-road reading counts only beyond 3.5 m from a Driving-lane centre, so
#     junction false alarms do not end episodes. Lane invasion only sees painted
#     markings: Town01's curb edges are unmarked, so leaving the road there was
#     cheap in training while the eval ended the episode (15 of 40 Town01 eval
#     failures at run N's 100k were off-road).
#   * AN IDLE CHARGE: 0.5 a step below 2 km/h (EXPLORE_IDLE_PENALTY,
#     EXPLORE_IDLE_SPEED_KMH; v10's cure for v8's parking). Run N had started to
#     park: 6 of its last 10 Town05 episodes stalled, near-zero throttle on 25% of
#     steps, while standing still cost nothing. 2 km/h sits below the 10 km/h
#     arrival speed, so slowing to arrive stays free.
. "$REPO/slurm/sac_scratch_2t_u5.env"
export EXPLORE_OFF_ROAD_FATAL=1 OFF_ROAD_JUNCTION_M=3.5
export EXPLORE_IDLE_PENALTY=0.5 EXPLORE_IDLE_SPEED_KMH=2
